Subject: [PATCH] fix(parametros): accept presupuesto as talonario type

The casuistica seed inserts a presupuesto numbering series, and VentasService.crear assigns numbers for every comprobante type. The Pydantic contract and BO only allowed pedido/remito/factura, so GET /parametros/talonarios returned 500.

Keep the seed row; align the schema. Also import Talonario in seed_casuistica so the demo row actually persists.
---
